# Pack zips are GitHub release assets, not repo files. Git blocks files over
# 100 MiB, and Cloudflare Pages caps a single asset at 25 MiB — so they are
# never committed or deployed with the site. Keep the local copy and publish
# it with `npm run packs:upload`.
